{
  "$comment": "APPROVED PUBLIC HOMEPAGE COMPOSITION (v3) — mobile-first, white-dominant, built only from blocks that already exist in the CMS registry. Order follows the owner brief: teacher hero → choose your grade → the learning content (subjects and fields) → what the platform gives you → free lessons → video → files and notebooks → exams → how to start → about the teacher → contact → CTA. Rules: ONE card grammar and ONE button grammar (app/lib/publicStyles.ts), light surfaces with navy + soft blue and gold as the only accent, no gradients, no invented content (every data-driven block collapses when its table is empty, and the identity/contact blocks collapse while the owner has not filled them in), and every destination is /study, /p/contact, /register or a real in-page anchor. The legacy catalog (/courses…) stays reachable for existing links and SEO but is never advertised here. The teacher photo is never stored in this file: it comes from Settings -> Identity (identity.ownerPhotoFileId -> R2 -> /files/:id).",
